## 4. HTML page generation

Copy the full gold template tree and apply substitutions:

```
cp -r frontend/project/gold/ frontend/project/<m>/
```

Then run `src/tools/adapt_html.py --material <m> --primary <PRIMARY_HEX> --dark <DARK_HEX>`

The script applies these substitutions across all copied HTML files:

| Find | Replace |
|------|---------|
| `gold_supply_chain_ui.json` | `<m>_supply_chain_ui.json` |
| `gold_value_chain_ui.json` | `<m>_value_chain_ui.json` |
| `gold_value_metrics.json` | `<m>_value_metrics.json` |
| `gold_value_ndc_metrics.json` | `<m>_value_ndc_metrics.json` |
| `Gold Supply Chain` | `<Material> Supply Chain` |
| `Gold Value Chain` | `<Material> Value Chain` |
| `Gold –` | `<Material> –` |
| `🏅` | `<commodity_emoji>` |
| `#c9922a` (gold primary) | `<PRIMARY_HEX>` |
| `#2c3e50` (gold dark) | `<DARK_HEX>` |
| `#1a2535` (gold darkest) | `<DARK_HEX_DEEPENED>` |
| Cross-links to `../../gold/` | Update to point at gold correctly |
| Cross-links to `../../shea/` | Remove or replace with `../../<m>/` |

**Then manually rewrite `project_context.html`** from the PDI data:
- Header KPIs: from `programme_scale` and `geographic_scope`
- Phases flow: from `module_3.phase_map`
- Actor list: from `module_1.A7_actor_classes`
- Sources list: from `sources_overview`
- Notes: from `summary.analyst_notes`

