## 6. Commodity hub and homepage

### `frontend/project/<m>/index.html`
Adapt from `gold/index.html`. Keep only Supply Chain and Value Chain cards.
Remove Game Theory card (moved to Research section).

### `index2.html`
Add a new card to the **Projects** section:

```html
<a href="frontend/project/<m>/index.html" class="card <m>">
  <div class="card-icon"><emoji></div>
  <div class="card-title"><Material></div>
  <div class="card-desc"><one-line description from PDI A2_market_state></div>
  <span class="card-tag"><Material> – Supply & Value Chain Hub</span>
</a>
```

Add CSS: `.card.<m> { border-left: 4px solid <PRIMARY_HEX>; }`

