## 7. Post-generation checklist

- [ ] `data/frontend/<m>_supply_chain_ui.json` exists and is valid JSON
- [ ] `frontend/project/<m>/supply_chain/scenarios.json` exists
- [ ] All DATA_URL paths in copied HTML files resolve to existing files
- [ ] `project_context.html` contains material-specific content (not gold boilerplate)
- [ ] `index.html` has the new project card
- [ ] No `null` fields in `phase_meta` or `phases.synthetic` for D/C/balance/N
- [ ] Emissions/energy/water fields that are `null` display gracefully (not as errors)
- [ ] `value_chain/dashboard.html` uses commodity-specific metric slugs (not `aisc_usd_per_oz`)
- [ ] `<m>_value_metrics.json` metric_name values match what the dashboard JS filters for
- [ ] `value_chain/what_if_simulator.html` uses commodity-specific sliders and outputs (not AISC/oz)
- [ ] What-if simulator loads data from `<m>_value_metrics.json` and shows non-zero baseline values
- [ ] `value_chain/financial_report.html` uses commodity-specific income statement structure (not AISC/oz)
- [ ] Supply chain pages cite commodity-appropriate data sources (not Newmont/WGC/ICMM by default)
- [ ] Emissions intensity denominator matches commodity unit (not t/oz)
